{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05820","headline":"奉和圣制登降圣观与宰臣等同望应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制登降圣观与宰臣等同望应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤扆朝碧落，龙图耀金镜。\n维岳降二臣，戴天临万姓。\n山川八校满，井邑三农竟。\n比屋皆可封，谁家不相庆。\n林疎远村出，野旷寒山静。\n帝城云里深，渭水天边映。\n佳气含风景，颂声溢歌咏。\n端拱能任贤，弥彰圣君圣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}